all court with Mixed Reality mode. You can use your hand to grab the ball and throw it, or you can use controller for more precise movement.\n\nArcade Mode: Rack up points and break your own high scores.\n\nChallenge Mode: Push your limits with a moving basket and unpredictable shot angles.\n\nPractice Mode: Fine tune your technique by adjusting the hoop\u2019s height and position to your liking.\n\nStep in, take the shot, and let the game come to life around you.", "short_description": "Play Basketball with Hand Tracking in Mixed Reality mode. Play anywhere with just your hand. Beat your high score in Arcade mode, challenge yourself with a moving basket, or adjust the hoop\u2019s position for focused practice."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://foristudio.com/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fori Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://foristudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25111594788469966"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619836_1126872892749374_3771335018134577427_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PjHwcMda9dwQ7kNvwH